  "guided_witnesses": "Constraints only remove schedules from Spec and keep all safety invariants. Both positive instances are unrestricted. Coverage is not liveness.",
  "assumptions": [
    "Ordered winning epochs represent never-reused root incarnations; competing election candidates are not modeled",
